{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"北角春秧街大廈單位起火 濃煙衝天 消防升雲梯灌救\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/696e47507d86350b0ad8b23ac9df982c/2026-11/collage_65.jpg\"/><p>北角春秧街近北角道一大廈中層單位，今日（11月16日）下午3時半左右起火，濃煙衝天，火舌冒出窗戶。消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊，並升雲梯灌救。火警中暫時未有受傷報告，起因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：Lai Siuyib@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c72c20a1ac9c6c1170427aaebab64aa/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-16-16h00m55s875.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為北角春秧街近北角道一大廈中層單位。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bee89402491c91aa14609819243c3255/2026-11/n1_0.png\"/><img alt=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fa88a53147eb52d69b0695259744c51/2026-11/n2.png\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0e4d60e9355b41bba00704433ce72e4/2026-11/n4.png\"/><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯灌救。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28887860941ecaba4f5da18920f0847a/2026-11/907650701_4180432795592806_7652305573594729567_n_0.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:45.355578+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:20.836634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:20.836634+00:00","content_hash":"0fbe34dee89ae2d271c1579ef4bae590ee5c27761211282d72a34eb3793b7385","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}